          en: 'This article expands the trail\'s strategic perspective by connecting professional mindset with awareness of the external environment. While previous articles focused on personal positioning and portfolio, this one expands the view to the macro forces that influence the market. Strategic professionals don\'t operate in isolation. they understand the complete ecosystem in which they operate.',
