          en: 'A registered trademark is an asset that can be valued, licensed, and even sold. For entrepreneurs, having registered trademarks demonstrates professionalism and long-term vision. For investors, intellectual property protection is a criterion for evaluating business maturity.\n\nBeyond financial value, trademark registration offers legal security. You can operate in the market with the peace of mind that nobody will claim the right to the name you built. This security allows investing in branding and marketing with confidence.\n\nFor tech professionals who build personal projects, trademark registration is frequently neglected until the project gains traction. At that point, discovering that the name was already registered by someone else can force a rebrand that destroys months or years of reputation building.',
